<strong>What we need from you</strong><br />
<br />
To assist in reviewing your claim, please provide as much of the following information as possible, which you can send through to us by replying to this email:
<ul>
	<li>Baggage receipts given to you at check in;&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Proof of purchase&nbsp;– includes&nbsp;brand of bag, age of bag, original cost of bag.&nbsp;</li>
	<li>Pictures of damage to bag&nbsp;</li>
	<li>For brand name bags/items please provide the authentication information.</li>
</ul>
<strong>We're here to help &nbsp;</strong><br />
<br />
If you need urgent assistance or have any questions, our Baggage Services team is available on 1300 306 980.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
For further information about baggage that has been delayed, damaged or lost, please visit <a href="https://www.qantas.com/au/en/travel-info/baggage/baggage-services.html#damaged-checked-baggage">Baggage Services</a> on our website. I look forward to resolving this for you as soon as possible.</body>
